Without a gateway, the client must call multiple services.

Example:

GET https://userservice/api/users
GET https://orderservice/api/orders
GET https://paymentservice/api/payments

Problems:

Client must know multiple URLs

If service endpoints change, the client must update

This tightly couples the client with backend services.

2️⃣ Complex Client Logic

Clients must handle:

Service discovery

Load balancing

Error handling

Retry logic

Example flow:

Client
 ↓
Call User Service
 ↓
Call Order Service
