This makes the frontend application complex.

3️⃣ Security Issues

Without centralized security:

Each microservice must implement authentication

Each service validates tokens individually

Example authentication using
JSON Web Token

Problem:

Duplicate security logic

Hard to maintain

With a gateway, authentication happens once at the gateway layer.

4️⃣ No Centralized Rate Limiting

